.TH XMTEXTFIELDGETXMSTRING 3 2026-02-03 "Motif 2.5.3"
.SH NAME
XmTextFieldGetXmString - Get the compound string value of a TextField

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <Xm/Xm.h>
.P
\fBXmString XmTextFieldGetXmString\fR(\fBWidget\fR w);
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
Retrieves a copy of the \fBXmString\fP value behind the given
\fBXmTextField\fP widget.

.IP "\fIw\fP" 12
\fBXmTextField\fP widget for which to get the value.

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a newly-allocated copy of the \fBXmString\fP value of the given
widget. NULL is returned if invalid parameters are passed. The returned
\fBXmString\fP must be freed with \fBXmStringFree\fP().

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBXmTextFieldSetXmString\fP(3),
\fBXmTextFieldSubstring\fP(3)

.SH AUTHOR
Tim Hentenaar <tim@hentenaar.com>

